  "description": "dotnet new templates for Kazo OS: window app, terminal command, service, ASP.Kazo site, host and app repository solution.",
  "id": "Kazo.Os.Templates",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-13T15:05:48.587Z",
